# Only test sources and data are versioned. Everything tests write (logs,
# screenshots, suite output) stays local. A new kind of file the tests need gets a
# `!` line here; check with `git status --short --ignored tests/` (`!!` = ignored).
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!.gdignore
!README.md
!*.gd
!*.tscn
!*.tres
!*.sh
!*.py
!*.txt
!*.json
!*.csv
!*.cfg
integration/suite/
integration/durations.json
